    "text": "## Description\r\n\r\nThis dataset contains ground reference crop type labels in an area located in Brandenburg, Germany.\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Source Data Curator:** [European Space Agency](https://beta.source.coop/esa/fusion-competition/)\r\n- **Source Data Provider:** [European Space Agency](https://beta.source.coop/esa/fusion-competition/)\r\n- **Converted by:** Kerner Lab (ASU)\r\n- **License:** DL-DE/BY-2-0\r\n- **Projection:** EPSG:4326\r\n- **Train Dataset Validity:** 2018\r\n- **Test Dataset Validity:** 2019\r\n\r\n\r\n--- \r\n\r\n## Attributes\r\n\r\n| Property                  | Data Type |\r\n| ------------------------- | --------- |\r\n| id                        | string    |\r\n| determination_datetime    | datetime  |\r\n| geometry                  | polygon   |\r\n| area                      | float     |\r\n| perimeter                 | float     |\r\n| crop_id                   | string    |\r\n| crop_name                 | string    |"
  },
